@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "developer@example.test",
  "password": "replace-with-12-or-more-characters",
  "first_name": "Developer",
  "last_name": "Example"
}

### Login (username is email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=developer%40example.test&password=replace-with-12-or-more-characters

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nutrition search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nutrition/search?q=rice

### Recognition multipart (replace path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/recognize-food
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=NutriBoxBoundary

--NutriBoxBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="meal.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./meal.png
--NutriBoxBoundary--

### Meal analysis multipart (replace path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meals/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=NutriBoxBoundary

--NutriBoxBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="weight_grams"

180
--NutriBoxBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="meal.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./meal.png
--NutriBoxBoundary--

### Create meal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"food_id":1,"weight_grams":"180"}]}

### Meal history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/meals?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/progress/weekly?week_start=2026-08-10&timezone=Asia%2FManila
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Targets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/targets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mock coach
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/coach?timezone=Asia%2FManila
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"How am I doing today?"}
